---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import FabiApp from '@/components/FabiApp.tsx';
---
<Layout
  title="Fabian Murauer – Software Developer"
  description="Fabian Murauer (Red_Wolf2467) – Software developer, founder of Avocloud.net."
  canonical="https://avocloud.net/fabi/"
  schema={false}
>
  <FabiApp client:load>

      <!-- About -->
      <section class="section" id="about">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">ABOUT ME</div>
          <div class="grid cols-2">
            <div>
              <h2 class="headline sub">Hi, I'm Fabian.</h2>
              <p class="prose">
                I'm a software developer from Wels, Austria with around five years of experience -
                what started as tinkering around quickly grew into a real passion. I love building
                things that actually get used and working on the kind of diverse projects that keep
                things interesting.
              </p>
              <p class="prose">
                As the founder of Avocloud.net, I build and run our products: Discord moderation, event
                ticketing and grade management. My role covers full-stack development, server
                administration, network technology, and project leadership.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="sub-h">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/>
                </svg>
                Tech Philosophy
              </h3>
              <p class="prose">
                I'm a passionate Linux user - my main PC runs Linux exclusively (sorry Microsoft!).
                I believe in self-hosting and maintaining control over my digital environment. From my
                own private cloud infrastructure to self-hosted password managers and even my own VPN -
                I prefer running everything on my own servers rather than relying on third-party providers.
              </p>
              <h3 class="sub-h">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
                </svg>
                Education
              </h3>
              <p class="prose">
                Currently attending <strong>HTL Traun</strong>, where my curriculum covers
                Medientechnik, network engineering, IT security, and database systems.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Journey / timeline -->
      <section class="section" id="timeline">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">JOURNEY</div>
          <h2 class="headline">My Journey</h2>
          <!-- A measured rail with registration dots. The rail draws itself and
               the dots strike in as the section arrives — see slot-motion.ts. -->
          <ol class="timeline">
            <span class="timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2026</span>
              <div class="tl-title">Paramedic Training · Red Cross</div>
              <p>Completing Sanitäter training with the Austrian Red Cross. Theoretical exam scheduled for late May 2026, practical hours to follow.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2025</span>
              <div class="tl-title">EduGrade &amp; QrGate · JRK Helfer</div>
              <p>EduGrade released for grade management. QrGate deployed in production for Helenenbühne Sattledt events. Stepped up as Betreuer at Jugendrotkreuz.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2024</span>
              <div class="tl-title">Avocloud.net Launch</div>
              <p>Launched Avocloud.net to build and run software products and infrastructure.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2023</span>
              <div class="tl-title">HTL Traun · Baxi Verified</div>
              <p>Started at HTL Traun (Medientechnik), covering network engineering, IT security, and database systems. Baxi became a verified Discord bot used in thousands of servers.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2022</span>
              <div class="tl-title">Helenenbühne Sattledt</div>
              <p>Took over full technical operations for the local theater group: sound, lighting, video production, and web infrastructure including email servers.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2020</span>
              <div class="tl-title">First Lines of Code</div>
              <p>Started programming with Python. What began as tinkering and curiosity quickly grew into a daily passion for building things that get used.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-item">
              <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="tl-year">2019</span>
              <div class="tl-title">Joined JRK as Kid</div>
              <p>Joined the Austrian Youth Red Cross (Jugendrotkreuz) as a kid member.</p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <section class="section" id="skills">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">SKILLS</div>
          <h2 class="headline">My Skills</h2>
          <div class="grid cols-3">
            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
                Programming
              </h3>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Python — Advanced</span>
                <span class="chip">HTML / CSS — Advanced</span>
                <span class="chip">JavaScript — Basic</span>
                <span class="chip">PHP — Basic</span>
                <span class="chip">Java — Beginner</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/></svg>
                Server &amp; Infrastructure
              </h3>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Linux Server — Intermediate</span>
                <span class="chip">Docker — Intermediate</span>
                <span class="chip">Network Security — Intermediate</span>
                <span class="chip">Nginx — Intermediate</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
                Tools &amp; Technologies
              </h3>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Git &amp; GitHub — Advanced</span>
                <span class="chip">REST APIs — Advanced</span>
                <span class="chip">AI Prompting — Advanced</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Projects -->
      <section class="section" id="projects">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">PROJECTS</div>
          <h2 class="headline">My Projects</h2>
          <div class="grid cols-3">

            <div class="card span-2">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
                Baxi
              </h3>
              <p>A verified Discord bot featuring intelligent chat filtering, a global spammer database, and advanced moderation tools. Built with Python and actively maintained.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Discord</span>
                <span class="chip">Moderation</span>
                <span class="chip">Security</span>
                <span class="chip">Python</span>
                <a class="chip link" href="https://baxi.avocloud.net/" rel="noreferrer">Dashboard ↗</a>
                <a class="chip link" href="/baxi/invite/">Invite ↗</a>
                <a class="chip link" href="/baxi/">About ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21 2-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0 3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4"/></svg>
                PWGEN
              </h3>
              <p>A secure, privacy-focused password generator. No tracking, no external requests.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Security</span>
                <a class="chip link" href="/pwgen/">Website ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card span-2">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
                QrGate
              </h3>
              <p>A full-featured event ticketing system with integrated shop, PayPal payment, automated email delivery, and QR code check-in.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Python</span>
                <span class="chip">Events</span>
                <span class="chip">Ticketing</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg>
                EduGrade
              </h3>
              <p>Secure grade management for educators - AES-256-GCM encrypted with built-in analytics.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Python</span>
                <span class="chip">Education</span>
                <span class="chip">Encrypted</span>
                <a class="chip link" href="/edugrade/">About ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card span-2">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3Z"/><path d="m6.2 5.3 3.1 3.9"/><path d="m12.4 3.4 3.1 3.8"/><path d="M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/></svg>
                Helenenbühne Sattledt
              </h3>
              <p>Website and ticketing system for the parish theater group in Sattledt, Austria. I built and maintain their website and operate QrGate as their custom ticketing &amp; shop solution.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Website</span>
                <span class="chip">Ticketing</span>
                <span class="chip">QrGate</span>
                <span class="chip">Theater</span>
                <a class="chip link" href="https://helenenbuehne.at" rel="noreferrer">Website ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Community -->
      <section class="section" id="community">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">COMMUNITY</div>
          <h2 class="headline">Beyond the Code</h2>

          <div class="card mb">
            <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
            <h3>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3Z"/><path d="m6.2 5.3 3.1 3.9"/><path d="m12.4 3.4 3.1 3.8"/><path d="M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/></svg>
              Helenenbühne Sattledt
            </h3>
            <p>Local theater group - I handle the full technical side, from stage to code.</p>
            <div class="grid cols-2 mb">
              <ul class="bullets">
                <li>Event technology: sound, video &amp; lighting</li>
                <li>Website development &amp; maintenance</li>
              </ul>
              <ul class="bullets">
                <li>Built and operate QrGate - their custom ticketing &amp; shop system</li>
                <li>Email server management</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">Event Tech</span>
              <span class="chip">Theater</span>
              <span class="chip">Sound &amp; Light</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid cols-2">
            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
                RK – Rotes Kreuz
              </h3>
              <h4 class="sub-label">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                JRK – Youth Red Cross
              </h4>
              <p>Volunteer at the Austrian Youth Red Cross - I help prepare and run youth sessions and look after the kids alongside other volunteers.</p>
              <h4 class="sub-label">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
                Paramedic Training
              </h4>
              <p>I am currently completing my paramedic (Sanitäter) training with the Red Cross. The theoretical exam is scheduled for late May 2026 - after that, many practical hours still lie ahead before completion.</p>
              <div class="chips mt">
                <span class="chip">First Aid</span>
                <span class="chip">Youth Work</span>
                <span class="chip">Paramedic (in training)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Zm0 0a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-9c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h2"/><path d="M18 14h-8"/><path d="M15 18h-5"/><path d="M10 6h8v4h-8V6Z"/></svg>
                Kontakte – Sattledt
              </h3>
              <p>Design the children's page for <em>Kontakte</em>, the local community and parish magazine in Sattledt.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Design</span>
                <span class="chip">Print</span>
                <span class="chip">Community</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Setup -->
      <section class="section" id="setup">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">SETUP</div>
          <h2 class="headline">My Setup</h2>
          <div class="grid cols-3">

            <div class="card span-2">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 16V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9m16 0H4m16 0 1.28 2.55a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45L4 16"/></svg>
                ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16 (2024)
              </h3>
              <p>My daily driver for development, design, and everything else.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Fedora 43 Workstation</span>
                <span class="chip">Intel Core Ultra 9 185H</span>
                <span class="chip">RTX 4060 Mobile</span>
                <span class="chip">32 GB RAM</span>
                <span class="chip">2560×1600 · 240 Hz</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/></svg>
                Raspberry Pi 4B
              </h3>
              <p>Home server - private cloud storage &amp; sync.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Armbian</span>
                <span class="chip">4 GB RAM</span>
                <span class="chip">1.83 TB SSD</span>
                <span class="chip">Nextcloud</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card span-2">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/></svg>
                ASUS TUF Gaming A17 (2019)
              </h3>
              <p>Repurposed as a home AI &amp; services server.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Fedora 43 Server</span>
                <span class="chip">AMD Ryzen 5 4600H</span>
                <span class="chip">GTX 1650 Ti Mobile</span>
                <span class="chip">24 GB RAM</span>
                <span class="chip">Ollama</span>
                <span class="chip">OpenWebUI</span>
                <span class="chip">UptimeKuma</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"/></svg>
                Strato VPS
              </h3>
              <p>External cloud servers for production services.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">Ubuntu Linux</span>
                <span class="chip">Fedora Linux</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="section" id="contact">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">CONTACT</div>
          <h2 class="headline">Get in Touch</h2>
          <div class="card narrow">
            <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
            <p>Have a project idea, a question, or just want to say hi? Feel free to reach out.</p>
            <a href="mailto:fabian.murauer@avocloud.net" class="accent-link">fabian.murauer@avocloud.net ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

  </FabiApp>
</Layout>
